          "renderType": "richText",
          "tag": "p",
          "content": "Lemons are one of the most versatile fruits around, prized for their sharp acidity, fragrant zest, and endless uses in the kitchen and beyond. Whether you're brightening up a dish, mixing a drink, or just need a natural cleaning trick, the humble lemon usually delivers. A few of the ways lemons show up:"
