        {
          "renderType": "richText",
          "tag": "p",
          "content": "Beyond the kitchen, lemons have long symbolized freshness, cleanliness, and a little bit of cheerful energy. They're also a good source of vitamin C, which hasn't hurt their reputation over the centuries. And sometimes inspirational quotes like this one:"
